          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks; that unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      "Ability§Dok’s Toolz": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability."
      },
      "Ability§Drill Boss": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Drill Through": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model ends a Charge move, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of it and roll one D6: on a 2-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 6, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Drive-by Dakka": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack that targets a unit within 9″, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Ability§Drive-by Krumpin’": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit Consolidates, each model in this unit can move up to 6″ instead of up to 3″."
      },
      "Ability§Explosive Presents (aura)": {
        "text": "While a friendly **Gretchin** unit is within 6″ of this model, that unit has the **Grenades** keyword and, each time such a unit uses the Grenade Stratagem, add 1 to the result of each dice rolled to see how many mortal wounds are inflicted."
      },
      "Ability§Fix Dat Armour Up": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, in your Command phase, you can return 1 destroyed Bodyguard model to that unit."
      },
      "Ability§Fixit da Grot": {
        "text": "At the start of your Command phase, this model regains up to D3 lost wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Flashiest Gitz": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack, you can re-roll the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Fortification": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While an enemy unit is only within Engagement Range of one or more Fortifications from your army: \n\n*  That unit can still be selected as the target of ranged attacks, but each time such an attack is made, unless it is made with a Pistol, subtract 1 from the Hit roll. \n\n*  Models in that unit do not need to take Desperate Escape tests due to Falling Back while Battle-shocked, except for those that will move over enemy models when doing so."
      },
      "Ability§Fuel-mixa Grot": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model’s unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6″ to the Move characteristic of models in this model’s unit."
      },
      "Ability§Full Throttle": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back."
      },
      "Ability§Furious Barrage": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit that contains five or more models, you can re-roll the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Gargantsmasha": {
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack that targets a **Titanic** unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll and you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Gargantuan": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, it can move over models (excluding Titanic models) and terrain features that are 4″ or less in height as if they were not there."
      },
      "Ability§Get Da Good Bitz": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the end of your Command phase, if this unit is within range of an objective marker you control, that objective marker remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at\nthe start or end of any turn."
      },
      "Ability§Ghazghkull’s Waaagh! Banner (aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While a friendly Orks unit is within 12″ of Makari, if the Waaagh! is active for your army, melee weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Gifts for All! (aura)": {
        "text": "While a **Gretchin** unit is within 6″ of this model, that unit’s Thievin’ Scavengers ability is successful on D6 rolls of 2+, instead of rolls of 4+."
      },
      "Ability§Grot Riggers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the start of your Command phase, this model regains 1 lost wound."
      },
      "Ability§Gun-crazy Show-offs": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a model in this unit targets the closest eligible target with its snazzgun, until the end of the phase, that weapon has an Attacks characteristic of 4."
      },
      "Ability§Has Yoo Been A Good Little Grot This Year?": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, in your Shooting phase, you can target this model’s unit with the Grenade Stratagem for 0CP, and can do so even if you have already targeted a different unit with that Stratagem this phase."
      },
      "Ability§Hogboss": {
