            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "For each model embarked within this Transport, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this model’s butcha boyz weapon (to a maximum of +6). The Attacks characteristic of that weapon can be modified even though it is an Extra Attacks weapon."
      },
      "Ability§One Last Kill": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit is destroyed by a melee attack, if it has not fought this phase, roll one D6 on a 4+, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Ability§One Scalpel Short of A Medpack": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, that unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Ability§Outflank": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "When this unit arrives from Strategic Reserves, it can be set up within your opponent’s deployment zone (all other restrictions still apply)."
      },
      "Ability§Patrol Squad": {
        "text": "At the start of the Declare Battle Formations step this unit can be split into two units, each containing five models. (when splitting a unit in this way, make a note of which models form each of the two new units. If you are splitting a unit that is equipped with 1 bomb squig and/or 1 distraction grot, only one of the new units can use that ability during the battle – make a note of which of the new units this will be)."
      },
      "Ability§Piston-driven Brutality": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model ends a Charge move, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of it and roll one D6: on a 2‑5, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 6, that enemy unit suffers D3+3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Plummeting Descent": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "You can re-roll Charge rolls made for this model’s unit in a turn in which it was set up on the battlefield from Reserves."
      },
      "Ability§Prophet of Da Great Waaagh!": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this unit is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Hit roll and add 1 to the Wound roll and if the Waaagh! is active for your army, a Critical Hit is scored on a successful unmodified Hit \nroll of 5+."
      },
      "Ability§Pulse Jet": {
        "text": "Each time this unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase:\n\n■ Add 6\" to the Move characteristic of models in this unit.\n\n■ Models in this unit can move through models and terrain features"
      },
      "Ability§Pyromaniaks": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack with a burna that targets an enemy unit within 6″, re-roll a Wound roll of 1. If the target of that attack is also within range of an objective marker, you can re-roll the Wound roll instead."
      },
      "Ability§Ramshackle But Rugged": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time an attack is allocated to this model, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Ability§Ramshackle Cover": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a ranged attack is allocated to a model, if that model is not fully visible to every model in the attacking unit because of this Fortification, that model has the Benefit of Cover against that attack."
      },
      "Ability§Rapid Fire": {},
      "Ability§Red Skull Kommandos": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Benefit of Cover."
      },
      "Ability§Rivetin’ Dakka": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks made with a rivet kannon. Until the start of your next turn, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is suppressed, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Roar of Mork (psychic)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your opponent’s Command phase, you can select one enemy unit within 18″ of and visible to this Psyker and roll one D6: on a 1, this Psyker’s unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 2+, until the start of your opponent’s next Command phase, that enemy unit is confrazzled. While a unit is confrazzled, each time a Battle-shock or Leadership test is taken for it, subtract 2 from that test."
      },
      "Ability§Rolling Fortress": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a ranged attack is allocated to an Orks model from your army, if that model is not fully visible to every model in the attacking unit because of this Deff Rolla Battle Fortress model, that model has the Benefit of Cover against that attack."
      },
      "Ability§Runtherd": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time an attack targets this unit, if it contains one or more Gretchin models, until that attack is resolved, Runtherd models in this unit have a Toughness characteristic of 2."
      },
      "Ability§Sawbonez": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the end of your Movement phase, select one friendly Beast Snagga Character model within 3″ of this model. That model is healed and regains up to 3 lost wounds. Each model can only be healed once per turn."
      },
      "Ability§Scatter!": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per turn, when an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move within 9″ of this unit, if this unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to 6″."
      },
      "Ability§Shokk Attack Engine": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, if this unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, you can remove it from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Ability§Shokk Tunnel": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model is selected to Advance,\nyou can remove it from the battlefield and set it up again anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 9” horizontally away from all enemy models instead of making an Advance move (this model is still considered to have Advanced this turn)."
      },
      "Ability§Shokk-boosta": {
        "text": "You can re-roll Advance rolls made for this model’s unit. In addition, each time this model’s unit makes a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, models in that unit can move through models and terrain features. When doing so, they can move within Engagement Range of such models but cannot end that move within Engagement Range of them, and any Desperate Escape test is automatically passed.’"
      },
      "Ability§Shooty Power Trip": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit is selected to shoot, you can roll one D6:\n\n- On a 1-2, this unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.\n- On a 3-4, until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit.\n- On a 5-6, until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit."
      },
      "Ability§Shoutin’ Pole (aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While a friendly Orks unit is within 6″ of this Fortification, improve the Leadership characteristic of models in that unit by 1."
      },
      "Ability§Single-minded Predator": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "You can target this model with the Heroic Intervention Stratagem for 0CP, and can do so even if you have already targeted a different unit with that Stratagem this phase."
      },
      "Ability§Snagged": {},
      "Ability§Sneaky Surprise": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Enemy units cannot use the Fire Overwatch Stratagem to shoot at this unit."
      },
      "Ability§Somethin’ to Prove": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This unit has +1 to Charge rolls."
      },
      "Ability§Special Dose": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While the Waaagh! is active for your army, add 6″ to the Move characteristic of models in this model’s unit."
      },
      "Ability§Speed Freeks": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Special"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If a model from your army with the Leader ability can be attached to a Warbikers unit, it can be attached to this unit instead."
      },
      "Ability§Speed Freeks Mob": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Special"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If a model from your army with the Leader ability can be attached to a Warbikers unit, it can be attached to this unit instead."
      },
      "Ability§Speedboss": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Spiked Ram": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model ends a Charge move, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of it and roll one D6: on a 2-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 6, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Spirit of Gork (psychic)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the start of the Fight phase, you can select one friendly Orks unit within 12″ of this model and roll one D6: on a 1, this model suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 2-5, until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in that unit; on a 6, until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in that unit and those weapons have the [LETHAL HITS] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Splat!": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack that targets a unit that is at its Starting Strength (excluding **Monsters** and **Vehicles**), re-roll a Hit roll of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Squig Mine": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of any phase, select one enemy unit within 3″ of this model and roll one D6: on a 4+, that enemy unit suffers D6 mortal wounds. \n\nDesigner’s Note: Place a Squig Mine token next to the model, removing it once this ability has been used."
      },
      "Ability§Stompin’ Forward": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, it can move over models (excluding Titanic models) and terrain features that are 4″ or less in height as if they were not there."
      },
      "Ability§Strafing Run": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a ranged attack that targets a unit that cannot Fly, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Super Runts": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit:\n\n* Models in that unit have the Scouts 9″ ability.\n\n* Each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll and add 1 to the Wound roll.\n\n* Each time an attack targets that unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Supreme Commander": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Special"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "setWarlord": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "set",
