      "Detachment§Wreckas": {
        "text": "**WRECKIN’ AND LOOTIN’**\n\nIn your Shooting phase, when a friendly **BREAKA BOYZ/FLASH GITZ/TANKBUSTAS** unit is **selected to shoot**, if any of the following apply, that unit’s attacks can re-roll **hit rolls** of 1:\n\n- That unit is within range of an **objective**.\n\n- The target of that attack is within range of an **objective**.",
