      "Detachment§Wurrband": {
        "text": "**POWERS OF DA WAAAGH!**\n\nFriendly **ORKS PSYKER** models’ **[PSYCHIC]** attacks have: \n\n- +1 **S**.\n- +1 **S** for every 5 models in this unit (or embarked within this model).\nFriendly **ORKS PSYKER** models have the following **psychic abilities**:\n\n**Roar of Mork (psychic level 1):** In your Movement phase, if this unit is not **battle-shocked**, you can make a **psychic roll** for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do: \n\n- On a 1, this unit is **battle-shocked**.\n- Select one enemy unit (excluding **MONSTER/VEHICLE** units) within 12\" of this unit. That enemy unit makes a **battle-shock roll**, with -1 from that **battle-shock roll** for every 10 models in this unit.\n\n**Visions of Violence (psychic level 1):** At the start of the Fight phase, if this unit is not **battle-shocked**, you can make a **psychic roll** for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do: \n\n- On a 1, this unit is **battle-shocked**.\n- This unit has **Fights First**.",
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "keywords": {
          "Role": [
            "Disruption"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
            "actions": [],
            "evals": [],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "pass"
          }
        }
      },
      "Detachment§Madcap Meks": {
        "text": "**UNPREDICTABLE GENIUS**\n\nIn your Shooting phase, when all of a friendly **BIG MEK/MEK GUNZ/MORKANAUT/WAZBOM BLASTAJET** unit's ranged attacks target a single enemy unit, roll one D6:\n\nUnpredictable Genius\nD6\nResult\n1\n**Dat's Weird:** The target unit has 4+ **InSv** until your unit has shot.\n2‑3\n**Hop Splat:** Select one other enemy unit within 3\" of the target. That unit suffers D3 **mortal wounds**.\n4\n**Seekerz:** Those attacks have +1 to **hit rolls**. \n5\n**Lifted:** The target unit has **FLY**, and cannot have the **benefit of cover**, until your unit has shot.\n6\n**Runtified:** The target unit has -1 **T** until your unit has shot.",
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "keywords": {
          "Role": [
            "Disruption"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
