        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Readied Brawlers": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **WAGON** unit ends a **normal move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WAGON** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Units embarked within your unit can make an **assault disembark move** (pg 121).",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Blitz Brigade"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Impending Krunch": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase, when a friendly **WAGON** unit ends a **charge move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WAGON** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each enemy unit **engaged** with your unit makes a **battle-shock roll**, with -1 to that **battle-shock roll**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Blitz Brigade"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Keep It Runnin’": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **unengaged** **ORKS INFANTRY** unit that was **eligible to fight** this phase and is wholly within 6\" of a friendly **TRANSPORT** unit that **INFANTRY** unit is able to embark within.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your **INFANTRY** unit embarks within that **TRANSPORT** unit.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Blitz Brigade"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§While Their Backs are Turned": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **unengaged** **BOYZ**/**KOMMANDOS/STORMBOYZ** unit that was **engaged** at the start of the phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **normal move** of up to 6\".",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Taktikal Brigade"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Mind Mostly on the Mission": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **BOYZ/KOMMANDOS/STORMBOYZ** unit is selected to make an **advance/fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **BOYZ/KOMMANDOS/STORMBOYZ** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to start an action**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Taktikal Brigade"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Dubious Restraint": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start/end of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **BOYZ**/**KOMMANDOS/STORMBOYZ** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **objective** your unit is controlling. That **objective** is **secured**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Taktikal Brigade"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Delicious Eating Squigs": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **RUKKATRUKK SQUIGBUGGIES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select any number of friendly **ORKS INFANTRY** units within 3\" of your unit. Each selected unit **heals** 3 wounds.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Kult of Speed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Flyin’ Headbutt": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **ORKS AIRCRAFT** unit is **destroyed**, before rolling for any **Deadly Demise**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit does not have the **Deadly Demise** ability. Select one enemy unit within 12\" of your unit and roll eight D6:\n\n- For each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 **mortal wound**.\nThen remove your unit from the battlefield.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Flyboyz"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Whirligig Evasion": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **unengaged** **DEFFKOPTAS** unit within 8\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **normal move** of: \n\n- Up to D6\".\n\n- __Or:__ If your unit is **riled up**, up to 6\".",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Flyboyz"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Drive-By Bustin’": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **ORKS TRANSPORT** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS TRANSPORT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks with weapons selected for the **Firing Deck** ability have +1 to **hit rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Wreckas"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Grab It": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **unengaged** **BREAKA BOYZ/FLASH GITZ/TANKBUSTAS** unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **BREAKA BOYZ/FLASH GITZ/TANKBUSTAS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** - Your unit can make a **normal move** of up to 6\", and must end that move within range of an **objective**.\n\n- Your unit is __not__ **eligible to declare a charge** until the end of the turn.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Wreckas"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Gun-crazy Show-offs": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **FLASH GITZ/TANKBUSTAS** unit hit by those attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit shoots using **normal shooting**, but while doing so your unit can only target that enemy unit.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Wreckas"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Breakin’ Heads": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **attached** **ORKS INFANTRY** unit becomes **battle‑shocked**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS INFANTRY** unit. You can target that unit with this **stratagem** even though it is **battle-shocked**.\n\n**EFFECT:** Roll one D3: \n\n- Your unit suffers a number of **mortal wounds** equal to the result.\n\n- Your unit is no longer **battle‑shocked**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "War Horde"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Hit ’Em Harder": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **ORKS** unit is selected to fight.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s melee attacks have **[LETHAL HITS]**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "War Horde"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Fungus-fuel Injection": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **ORKS MOUNTED/VEHICLE** unit is **selected to move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS MOUNTED/VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has +2\" **M**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "War Horde"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Close-range Dakka": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **ORKS** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks have:\n\n- **[RAPID FIRE 1]**.\n\n- __Or:__ If that attack already has **[RAPID FIRE]**, +1 to the value of that **[RAPID FIRE]** (e.g. **[RAPID FIRE 1]** becomes **[RAPID FIRE 2]**).",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "War Horde"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Mow ’Em Down": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **ORKS** **VEHICLE** unit (excluding **WALKER** units) that made a **charge move** this turn is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s melee attacks have:\n\n- **[CLEAVE 1]**.\n\n- __Or:__ If that attack already has **[CLEAVE]**, +1 to the value of that **[CLEAVE]** (e.g. **[CLEAVE 1]** becomes **[CLEAVE 2]**).",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "War Horde"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Scarper!": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of a friendly **unengaged** **GRETCHIN** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **GRETCHIN** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **normal move** of:\n\n- Up to D6\".\n\n- __Or:__ Up to 6\" instead if your unit is an **attached** unit.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Runt Swarm"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Grot Shields": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **ORKS INFANTRY** unit (excluding **GRETCHIN** units).\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **GRETCHIN** unit within 3\" of that **ORKS INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When a **hit roll** for that enemy unit’s ranged attacks that target that **ORKS** unit results in a hit, if a model in your **GRETCHIN** unit is on the battlefield, end the attack sequence for that attack and your **GRETCHIN** unit suffers 1 **mortal wound**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Runt Swarm"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Kustom Dakka": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **ORKS INFANTRY** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks that target a unit (excluding **MONSTER/VEHICLE** units) have +1 to **wound rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Shoota Boyz"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Glowin’ Dakka": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **ORKS INFANTRY** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks that target a unit within 9\" have +1 **AP**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Shoota Boyz"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Never Enough Dakka": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **ORKS INFANTRY** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks have **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Shoota Boyz"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Goaded Into Action": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **unengaged** **BEAST SNAGGA** unit that lost a wound as a result of those attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **surge move** of up to D6\". If your unit is **riled up**, it can re-roll that D6.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Da Big Hunt"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Stomping Juggernaut": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement/Charge phase, when a friendly **ORKS WALKER** unit is **selected to move** or **declares a charge**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS WALKER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **MOBILE**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Dread Mob"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Dread Power": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **ORKS WALKER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit is **riled up** until the start of your next turn.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Dread Mob"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Crazed Rampage": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **ORKS WALKER** unit (excluding **TITANIC** units).\n\n**TARGET:** That **ORKS WALKER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When a model in your unit is **destroyed**, if your unit has not been **selected to fight** this phase, roll one D6, with +3 to the result if your unit has **DEFF DREAD**:\n\n- On a 4+, do not remove that model from the battlefield. When your unit has fought, or at the end of the phase (whichever comes first), that model is removed from the battlefield.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Dread Mob"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Mob Mentality": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Battle-shock step of your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **ORKS INFANTRY** unit of 13+ models.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **visible** friendly **ORKS** unit within 12\" of your unit. That unit’s **battle-shock rolls** are automatically successful.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Green Tide"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Vindictive Artillerists": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **MEK GUNZ** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **MEK GUNZ** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks have: \n\n- **[LETHAL HITS]**.\n\n- __Or:__ **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**.\n\n- __Or:__ **[HAZARDOUS]**, **[LETHAL HITS]**, **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Madcap Meks"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Infested War Zone": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when an enemy unit has attacked.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **GRETCHIN** unit that was just **destroyed**. You can target that unit with this **stratagem** even though that unit was just **destroyed**.\n\n**EFFECT:** Add a new **GRETCHIN** unit to your army identical to your **destroyed** unit, in **strategic reserves**, at its **starting strength**, with its full wounds remaining.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Orks",
            "Runt Swarm"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
