      "Ability§That’ll Learn Ya": {
        "text": "_Once per battle round, per unit_\n\nWhen this unit becomes **battle-shocked**, if this unit contains 4+ Gretchin models, you can roll one D3:\n\n- That number of Gretchin models in this unit are **destroyed**.\n\n- This unit is no longer **battle-shocked**."
      },
